<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - PC Master Control</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for PC Master Control - Learn how we handle your technical data, permissions, and security.">
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: hsl(224, 71%, 4%);
            --card-bg: hsla(222, 47%, 8%, 0.7);
            --card-hover-bg: hsla(222, 47%, 12%, 0.85);
            --accent-blue: hsl(190, 100%, 50%);
            --accent-purple: hsl(282, 90%, 65%);
            --accent-green: hsl(145, 100%, 50%);
            --text-primary: hsl(210, 40%, 98%);
            --text-secondary: hsl(217, 19%, 74%);
            --text-dim: hsl(217, 10%, 50%);
            --border: hsla(222, 30%, 20%, 0.6);
            --border-hover: hsla(222, 30%, 35%, 0.8);
            --glow-blue: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.15);
            --glow-purple: rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.15);
        }

        /* Reset & Base Styles */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Ambient Glow Backgrounds */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -10%;
            left: -10%;
            width: 50vw;
            height: 50vw;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--glow-blue) 0%, transparent 70%);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        body::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20%;
            right: -10%;
            width: 60vw;
            height: 60vw;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--glow-purple) 0%, transparent 70%);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            background-color: rgba(4, 7, 17, 0.8);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 80px;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 22px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue) 0%, var(--accent-purple) 100%);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 60px 0 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF 30%, var(--text-secondary) 70%, var(--accent-blue) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .last-updated {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--accent-purple);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            background: rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.1);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            border: 1px solid rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.2);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        /* Layout Grid */
        .layout-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
            gap: 48px;
            padding-bottom: 100px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        /* Sidebar Navigation */
        .sidebar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 120px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        }

        .sidebar-title {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .toc-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .toc-link {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: block;
            padding: 4px 0;
        }

        .toc-link:hover {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .toc-link.active {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            font-weight: 600;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-blue);
            padding-left: 8px;
        }

        /* Content Area */
        .content {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        /* Sections */
        .policy-section {
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            scroll-margin-top: 120px;
        }

        .policy-section:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .policy-section h2 {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .section-icon {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .policy-section p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .intro-p {
            font-size: 18px !important;
            color: var(--text-primary) !important;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* Cards inside content */
        .sub-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .sub-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--border-hover);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .sub-card h3 {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .sub-card ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 4px;
        }

        .sub-card li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .sub-card li::before {
            content: "•";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1;
            top: 2px;
        }

        .sub-card li:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        /* Permission Badges Grid */
        .permissions-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .permission-badge {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .permission-badge:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-purple);
            background: rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.05);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .badge-icon {
            color: var(--accent-purple);
            background: rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.1);
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .badge-info h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .badge-info p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 0;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* Contact Section Specifics */
        .contact-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 0%, rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.05) 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 32px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 24px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .contact-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
        }

        .contact-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue) 0%, var(--accent-purple) 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 16px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .contact-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.45), 0 0 15px var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .contact-email {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        /* Toast notifications */
        .toast {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background: rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-purple);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            z-index: 1000;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .toast.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .layout-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 32px;
            }

            .sidebar {
                position: static;
                margin-bottom: 16px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
            .content {
                padding: 24px 16px;
            }
            .sub-card {
                padding: 16px;
            }
            .permissions-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header id="header">
        <div class="container header-content">
            <a href="#" class="logo" id="logo-link">
                <span class="logo-icon">🎮</span>
                <span>PC Master</span>
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-link" id="home-link">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
                Home
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <!-- Hero -->
        <section class="hero">
            <span class="last-updated">Last Updated: October 26, 2023</span>
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        </section>

        <!-- Layout Grid -->
        <div class="layout-grid">
            
            <!-- Sidebar Table of Contents -->
            <aside class="sidebar">
                <h3 class="sidebar-title">Sections</h3>
                <nav>
                    <ul class="toc-list">
                        <li><a href="#intro" class="toc-link active" id="toc-intro">Introduction</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#collect" class="toc-link" id="toc-collect">1. Information We Collect</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#permissions" class="toc-link" id="toc-permissions">2. Permissions Used</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#usage" class="toc-link" id="toc-usage">3. Data Usage & Security</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#third-party" class="toc-link" id="toc-third-party">4. Third-Party Services</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#changes" class="toc-link" id="toc-changes">5. Changes to Policy</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#contact" class="toc-link" id="toc-contact">6. Contact Us</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </aside>

            <!-- Main Content Card -->
            <article class="content">
                
                <!-- Introduction -->
                <section id="intro" class="policy-section">
                    <p class="intro-p">
                        <strong>PC Master Control</strong> ("we," "our," or "us") provides a remote management and monitoring application for your personal computer. Your privacy is of utmost importance to us. This Privacy Policy outlines how our application operates and our strict commitment to safeguarding your information.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <hr style="border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 32px 0;">

                <!-- 1. Information We Collect -->
                <section id="collect" class="policy-section">
                    <h2>
                        <span class="section-icon">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        1. Information We Collect
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We designed PC Master Control with a privacy-first approach. The app performs local operations and data retrieval solely to show system state and enable control.
                    </p>

                    <div class="sub-card">
                        <h3>
                            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>
                            Technical Data
                        </h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;">To facilitate the connection between your Android device and your PC, the app collects and processes:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>IP Addresses:</strong> Used exclusively to discover, identify, and establish a direct socket connection with your PC on your local network.</li>
                            <li><strong>System Statistics:</strong> Real-time readouts of CPU usage, GPU usage, RAM usage, storage details, and battery status from the connected host computer.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sub-card">
                        <h3>
                            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>
                            Files and Media
                        </h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>File Transfer:</strong> The app includes an interface to browse and transfer files directly between your mobile device and your connected PC. These files are processed locally and are never stored, cached, or uploaded to any remote server under our control.</li>
                            <li><strong>Screen Mirroring:</strong> The app leverages Android's Screen Capture API to stream your mobile display to your PC screen. This stream is transmitted locally and securely over your home network and is never saved or shared.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <hr style="border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 32px 0;">

                <!-- 2. Permissions Used -->
                <section id="permissions" class="policy-section">
                    <h2>
                        <span class="section-icon">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        2. Permissions Used
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        The application requests only the minimum set of permissions necessary to execute its primary utility functions:
                    </p>

                    <div class="permissions-grid">
                        <div class="permission-badge">
                            <div class="badge-icon">🌐</div>
                            <div class="badge-info">
                                <h4>Internet & Network</h4>
                                <p>Allows communication between the app and the PC server.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="permission-badge">
                            <div class="badge-icon">📶</div>
                            <div class="badge-info">
                                <h4>Wi-Fi State</h4>
                                <p>Used to auto-discover active host PCs on the local network.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="permission-badge">
                            <div class="badge-icon">⚡</div>
                            <div class="badge-info">
                                <h4>Foreground Service</h4>
                                <p>Maintains active screen mirroring and a stable connection link.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="permission-badge">
                            <div class="badge-icon">💾</div>
                            <div class="badge-info">
                                <h4>Storage Access</h4>
                                <p>Enables the direct transmission of files between devices.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <hr style="border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 32px 0;">

                <!-- 3. Data Usage and Security -->
                <section id="usage" class="policy-section">
                    <h2>
                        <span class="section-icon">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"></line><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"></line></svg>
                        </span>
                        3. Data Usage & Security
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We operate on a zero-data-collection philosophy:
                    </p>

                    <div class="sub-card">
                        <h3>🔒 No Third-Party Sharing</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px;">We do not sell, rent, trade, distribute, or otherwise disclose your technical system readouts or data to any third parties.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sub-card">
                        <h3>🏠 Local-Only Communication</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px;">All data transmission, screen streams, and files flow strictly over your Local Area Network (LAN). They do not exit your private home environment or route through cloud hops unless you have explicitly configured custom remote access ports on your own hardware.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sub-card">
                        <h3>🗑️ No Data Retention</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px;">We host no centralized telemetry or storage servers. The data displayed is strictly transient, existing only in-memory to power the current active dashboard session.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <hr style="border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 32px 0;">

                <!-- 4. Third-Party Services -->
                <section id="third-party" class="policy-section">
                    <h2>
                        <span class="section-icon">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        4. Third-Party Services
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        PC Master Control does not embed third-party advertising SDKs, behavioral analytics tracking toolkits (such as Google Analytics or Firebase Crashlytics), or telemetry aggregators. 
                    </p>
                </section>

                <hr style="border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 32px 0;">

                <!-- 5. Changes to This Policy -->
                <section id="changes" class="policy-section">
                    <h2>
                        <span class="section-icon">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21.5 2v6h-6M21.34 15.57a10 10 0 1 1-.57-8.38l5.67-5.67"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        5. Changes to This Policy
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to align with new features or security guidelines. If changes are published, we will update the "Last Updated" timestamp at the top of this document. We encourage you to review this page periodically to remain informed about our local data handling parameters.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <hr style="border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 32px 0;">

                <!-- 6. Contact Us -->
                <section id="contact" class="policy-section">
                    <h2>
                        <span class="section-icon">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg>
                        </span>
                        6. Contact Us
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        If you have questions, feedback, or need clarification regarding this Privacy Policy or the networking mechanisms utilized, feel free to reach out to us.
                    </p>
                    
                    <div class="contact-card">
